From: starrocks-flight <starrocks-flight@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fe: Arrow Flight SQL catalog connector (metadata, type
 mapping, remote SQL, secret masking)

Catalog type "flight": FlightConnector, FlightMetadata (cached schemas/tables/row counts), FlightProperties,
FlightSqlMetadataClient (Flight SQL metadata calls with URI failover), FlightTypeMapper, FlightSqlRenderer,
FlightTable / TableType FLIGHT. Secrets of the new properties are masked in PrintableMap, CredentialUtil,
SqlCredentialRedactor and the CatalogMgr logs.
